export anchor DarkFloatingPanelsStyle:
    number: 233
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Dark floating panels
    idea: Opaque indigo panels float over a deep tinted backdrop of slow indigo and teal light, each lifted by a soft periwinkle glow edge and a long shadow, with a floating dock for navigation and a floating pill for the header.
    base: dark
    palette:
        deep: #0b0d22, the backdrop base and the style sheet
        indigoLight: #1d1a5c, the upper left backdrop glow
        tealLight: #0b3340, the right backdrop glow
        panel: #151a3c, every floating panel, the dock and the header pill
        inset: #1b2148, rows inside panels, icon tiles and fields
        line: #2c3470, meter tracks, grid lines and field edges
        glowEdge: #5a68c8, the 1px edge on the current dock item and the secondary button
        ink: #eef0ff, text
        muted: #aab1d6, labels and meta
        periwinkle: #a5b4ff, the primary button, meters, the this week line, icons and focus
        onPeriwinkle: #10153a, text on periwinkle
        lastWeek: #7680b0, the dashed last week line
        ok: #7ee8b5, the On track pill
        risk: #ffd479, the At risk pill
        bad: #ffa3b3, the Behind pill and the overdue pill
    type:
        A rounded stack, ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded, Nunito, then system-ui,
        Segoe UI, Roboto. Base 14px at 1.5. The greeting is 40px at 700,
        chip figures 26px at 800, panel titles 17px at 700, project names
        14px at 700, status pills 12.5px at 700.
    layout:
        The whole screen is a stage with a deep navy base, two large soft
        radial glows in indigo and teal, and two faint thin ring shapes
        clipped by the stage. A floating vertical dock on the left holds a
        periwinkle B tile and six icon-only links with names, Home in an
        inset tile with a glowing edge. A long floating header pill holds
        search, a glowing periwinkle New project pill, a round bell and a
        gradient MO disc with Mara Okafor. The greeting sits straight on the
        backdrop with the date, Good morning, Mara and a pill reading 4
        tasks are overdue with a soft red ring and glow. On the right the
        four figures float as small glowing chips. Below, two columns of
        panels with 28px gaps. Projects, 6 in flight, holds six inset
        rounded rows with name, category and due, a ringed status pill, and
        a glowing periwinkle meter with percent and tasks. The right column
        holds Tasks completed as a glowing line chart, last week dashed and
        this week solid, and Recent activity with periwinkle icons in inset
        tiles. Below 1100px the columns stack. Below 760px the dock becomes
        a horizontal bar near the foot of the screen and the figures go two
        by two.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 28px gaps between panels so the backdrop shows, 22px panel padding, 10px between rows.
    density: Airy. Panels are few and large, with the greeting straight on the backdrop.
    corners: Very round. 22px panels, 28px dock, 16px rows, pill header, buttons and status.
    borders: No hard borders. Each panel has a 1px periwinkle ring at 22 percent as part of its glow.
    shadows: A floating glow made of 0 18px 50px deep navy at 60 percent plus a 36px periwinkle halo at 14 percent.
    icons:
        Round line icons at 1.8 stroke, 18px, periwinkle inside inset tiles.
        Status is a check circle, a triangle or a crossed square in a pill
        ringed in its colour, always with the word.
    focus: A 2px periwinkle outline offset 3px plus a 6px soft periwinkle halo.
    tone: Light and friendly, such as 6 in flight, Recent activity and Good morning, Mara.
